# SHA-256 of the Tor and lyrebird executables the app packages, one line per
# ABI and library: <abi>/<library> <sha256>. The build verifies the Tor
# executables built by packaging/tor-android (Tor 0.4.9.13, see its
# PROVENANCE.md) and the files it unpacks from
# org.briarproject:lyrebird-android:0.6.2 against these values before they
# are packaged, and the app verifies the file it is about to execute against
# them before every Tor start. Only the ABIs listed here are packaged.
